Action	Description
Continue or Pause
F5	Resume execution until the next breakpoint, or pause a running program.
Step Over
F10	Run the current line without stepping into function calls on that line.
Step Into
F11	Step into the function called on the current line.
Step Out
Shift+F11	Finish the current function and pause in the calling function.
Restart
Ctrl+Shift+F5	Stop and start the application again with the current debug configuration.
Stop
Shift+F5	End the current debugging session.
